flowchart LR
  User[Shopper] --> Chat[Conversation and guidance]
  User --> Workspace[Discover / Compare / Saved / Combination]
  Workspace --> Session[Per-tab selections and confirmed brief]
  Session --> Context[Bounded turn context]
  Context --> Chat
  Chat --> API[Validated server API]
  API --> Agent[Hosted concierge]
  Agent --> Catalogue[Read-only catalogue]
  Catalogue --> Curated[Retrieved records and curated IDs]
  Curated --> Workspace
  Agent --> Chat
  Workspace --> API
  API --> Catalogue
